homelab-accountmanage (0.1.23) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New admin Services tab: a service -> hosts accordion over the fleet data
    (reuses /admin/topology). Lists every service (dovecot, postfix, webproxy,
    haproxy, postgresql, pdns, api, ...); click one to see the hosts it runs
    on, their addresses, package + health. Filter box.

