homelab-accountmanage (0.1.22) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Topology tab: much bigger, more readable on desktop -- viewport-height
    inline canvas (was a fixed 580px) + a Fullscreen toggle (Esc to exit)
    that gives the map the whole screen. Marked desktop/laptop-only: a
    "desktop/laptop" note by the controls, and on small screens the graph is
    replaced by a clear "open on a computer" message instead of a cramped map.

